  "identity": "A mono-green ramp-control deck that uses Lander tokens and The Eternity Elevator to reach eight mana around turn six or seven, then lands a colorless Spacecraft whose enter-the-battlefield ability is a one-sided board sweeper. Extinguisher Battleship destroys a noncreature permanent and deals 4 damage to each creature, which this deck survives because its own bodies are 3/3, 5/5-and-growing, or 6/6. Station then converts the deck's surplus green power into evasion: tapping one 5-power creature turns the Battleship into a 10/10 flying trample artifact creature. Pinnacle Kill-Ship is the same plan one mana cheaper and at two copies.",
